{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49685","headline":"临江仙 二 · 阎选","name":"临江仙 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十二高峰天外寒，竹梢轻拂仙坛。\n宝衣行雨在云端，画帘深殿，香雾冷风残。\n欲问楚王何处去，翠屏犹掩金鸾。\n猨啼明月照空滩，孤舟行客，惊梦亦艰难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"阎选","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49685.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49685","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}